nts":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-21T20:18:22-07:00","id":1484666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1484662-errors-in-recent-demigod-release?p=1484663#post1484663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The most recent release I could find was on DriveThruRPG and is from two months ago, which is when it was put out for an errata pass. The errata'd version is supposed to be uploaded tomorrow. Which release version are you talking about?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, interesting. I got an update from Onyx path today saying I had new digital content to download, and it listed the Demigod book. I assumed it was the final version of the book...<br /> <br /> If I am in error, please disregard, accept my apologies, and lock this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23872-doryna","name":"Doryna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23872_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-22T07:18:08-07:00","id":1484701,"title":"","content":"Yesterday was the Demigod wallpaper and the PoD coupons (for when PoD goes live today). I saw the file update email from DTRPG this morning, so maybe check again and see if they got fixed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-22T13:43:52-07:00","id":1484724,"title":"","content":"Yup, they just hadn't updated the link. All is well. Apologies again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23872-doryna","name":"Doryna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23872_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-23T14:00:50-07:00","id":1484806,"title":"","content":"S'all good. It happens","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-25T19:59:45-07:00","id":1485005,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">No need for apologies. Despite power and internet outages at my home, I've downloaded the final revised copy of the PDF and compared it to the errata file I compiled two months ago. Of the 400+ pieces of errata I submitted, they implemented about 50. Around 90% of my submissions didn't get fixed. The final book literally has several hundred examples of bad spelling, grammar, punctuation, and incorrect word choice. I guess some people don't feel there is an appreciable difference between a &quot;pneumonic device&quot; which helps you breathe and a &quot;mnemonic device&quot; which helps you remember.<br /> <br /> They're also upholding the tradition of providing &quot;Ready to Play&quot; characters that are not ready to play. Emanuel has fewer Skill points than a starting Origin level character, having lost all 5 points from his Leadership Path Skill, and his Defense Roll is wrong. Hassan has no points in his Occult Path Skill (which should probably be impossible) and fewer Attribute points than a starting Origin level character; having lost his freebie dot in Resolve, which would boost his Defense Roll as well. Rhiannon is also missing her starting Origin level freebie Attribute dot.<br /> <br /> There are also points where text in one place contradicts text elsewhere. The book says none of the gods in this book have Titanic Virtues, but T\u0101whiri has a Titanic Virtue. The Usurping a Mantle text indicates you can strip a God of their three Callings using two methods outlined above, but only one of those two methods affects Callings. The divinity dice rules state both that &quot;If the roll fails and any of the divinity dice are not successes, it provokes a mortal failure&quot; and that &quot;if a roll fails and some divinity dice show successes, nothing spectacular happens&quot;, which means if you roll divinity dice and some come up as successes and some come up as failures, you provoke a mortal failure while nothing special happens.<br /> <br /> Finally, there are instances of rules &quot;crunch&quot; that violate established rules. The new Trickster Immortal Knacks include Disguised to Fate, which has a prerequisite of two other Immortal Trickster Knacks. Immortal Knacks require two Calling dots each, so taking Disguised to Fate requires six dots in the Trickster Calling, which is impossible. The Infernal Functionary Guide costs two dots and grants a Calling even though the rules require a Guide to cost three dots to provide that benefit.<br /> <br /> As you can tell, I am very frustrated by the state of the book.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}